{# What's new — dashboard teaser, driven by the what's-new API.
   Same position as the old static list (included on the SA dashboard
   and on the shared executive content). NEVER falls back to static
   entries: on API error the list stays empty and "See all" still
   works. The full list lives on /whats-new. #}
<section class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-5 sm:p-6 mt-6" aria-label="What's new">
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-blue-950">What's new</h2>
        <a class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 hover:underline shrink-0" href="/whats-new">See all</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Recent improvements in this app.</p>
    <p class="wn-teaser__status text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-4" data-wn-teaser-status role="status">Loading updates…</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600" data-wn-teaser-list hidden></ul>
    <p class="wn-teaser__empty text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-4" data-wn-teaser-empty hidden>အပ်ဒိတ်အသစ် မရှိသေးပါ။</p>
</section>
<script src="/static/js/whats-new-teaser.js" defer></script>
